{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>The cave of Machpelah.</b> A place whose name is Machpelah, as it says: <b>וַיָּקָם שְׂדֵה עֶפְרוֹן אֲשֶׁר בַּמַּכְפֵּלָה</b> (Genesis 23:17)." "<b>At the edge of his field.</b> So that for this he need not ruin his estate." "<b>For full silver.</b> For he has no desire to deduct from its value out of deference to you." "<b>In your midst.</b> In the presence of you all, for I do not ask for any time to pay the money. And so he did, as it says: <b>וַיִּשְׁקֹל אַבְרָהָם לְעֶפְרוֹן אֶת הַכֶּסֶף כּוּ' לְעֵינֵי בְנֵי חֵת</b> (Genesis 23:16)." "<b>For a burial-holding.</b> For even if he were to sell, perhaps he might contest that I not bury at his boundary; therefore I ask that he sell it as a burial-holding."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:31:15.650585879Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}